surname><given-names>DL</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2008</year><article-title>Use of fluorescence-activated vesicle sorting for isolation of naked2-associated, basolaterally-targeted exocytic vesicles for proteomic analysis</article-title><source>Mol Cell Proteomics</source><volume>7</volume><fpage>1651</fpage><lpage>1667</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18504258</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pbio-0060270-b011"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Gaietta</surname><given-names>GM</given-names></name><name><surname>Giepmans</surname><given-names>BN</given-names></name><name><surname>Deerinck</surname><given-names>TJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Smith</surname><given-names>WB</given-names></name><name><surname>Ngan</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Golgi twins in late mitosis revealed by genetically encoded tags for live cell imaging and correlated electron microscopy</article-title><source>Proc Natl Acad Sci U S A</source><volume>103</volume><fpage>17777</fpage><lpage>17782</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17101980</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pbio-0060270-b012"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Miyanari</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Atsuzawa</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Usuda</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Watashi</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Hishiki</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2007</year><article-title>The lipid droplet is an important organelle for hepatitis C virus production</article-title><source>Nat Cell Biol</source><volume>9</volume><fpage>1089</fpage><lpage>1097</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17721513</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pbio-0060270-b013"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Wileman</surname><given-name